<h3>Dashboard</h3>
The Dashboard shows the following links.
<h4>Prototypes</h4>
<p>
    Open the search page for the <strong>prototypes</strong>. This link is available only to users with prototypes functions granted.
</p>
<h4>Instances</h4>
<p>
    Open the search page for the <strong>instances</strong>. This link is available only to users with instances functions granted.
</p>
<h4>PIN</h4>
<p>
    Opens the light box to change the logged user <strong>PIN</strong>.
</p>
<h4>Logout</h4>
<p>
    Perform the <strong>logout</strong> of the logged user.
</p>
<h4>Help</h4>
<p>
    Open this <strong>help</strong>.
</p>
